00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.300 size:53% position:73% line:68%
pour augmenter leur résilience

00:01:51.433 --> 00:01:55.533 size:53% position:73% line:68%
face aux changements

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:56.766 size:53% position:73% line:68%
des écosystèmes.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.166 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Ici, Charlotte Dumoulin,

00:01:55.633 --> 00:01:57.166 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 Radio-Canada, à Prévost,

